<Slide
  style={{
    width: '1280px', height: '720px',
    background: '#F5F7FA',
    padding: '20px 60px',
    fontFamily: '"思源黑体", sans-serif',
  }}
>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', width: '100%', height: '100%', gap: 40 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 360, paddingTop: 20 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FF9F1C', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2, marginBottom: 12 }}>MONITORING</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#16263F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.35, marginBottom: 24 }}>
        生产监控：<br />上线才是真正的开始
      </Text>
      <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 4, background: '#22D3EE', marginBottom: 24 }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#5B6B7A', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
        评测测的是「已知」，监控盯的是「未知」。线上出问题，<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F' }}>要能定位到具体哪一步</span>。
      </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 12, padding: '20px 24px', boxShadow: '0 2px 12px rgba(22,38,63,0.06)' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 52, height: 52, borderRadius: 13, background: '#EAF2FB', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <FAIcon name='chart-line' style={{ fill: '#22D3EE', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F', marginBottom: 6 }}>OTel 追踪到工具层</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>OpenTelemetry 给每个工具调用、每轮循环打 trace，出问题定位到步骤。</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 12, padding: '20px 24px', boxShadow: '0 2px 12px rgba(22,38,63,0.06)' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 52, height: 52, borderRadius: 13, background: '#EAF2FB', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <FAIcon name='recycle' style={{ fill: '#22D3EE', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F', marginBottom: 6 }}>失败用例回流</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>线上失败的用例自动进测试集，同类问题不再复发——测试集会越滚越强。</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, background: '#16263F', borderRadius: 12, padding: '20px 24px' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 52, height: 52, borderRadius: 13, background: 'rgba(255,159,28,0.15)', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <FAIcon name='bell' style={{ fill: '#FF9F1C', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', marginBottom: 6 }}>告警机制 · 瑞士奶酪模型</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#DCE7F5', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>每层防线都有洞，单一防线会漏——多层叠加，洞才堵得住。</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 14, left: 60, width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>AI 从零开始 · 第 8 讲</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>10 / 12</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
